first person with full bullet tracers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive skybox tracks kills, shots fired, and ghost position live. Music intensity driven by a heat system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716110/extras/946f773e0c704b4c29110f067f625db0.avif?t=1779438632\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Cyberpunk extraction runner with bhop movement. Speed determines whether enemies can hit you. Race your own ghost through gauntlet levels, slide under barriers, chain crouch-bhops on ramps, and extract before the system catches up.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716110/d6888a7d37cd02b9805359763234fae71bc1e4a6/header.jpg?t=1779438632", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716110/b6ed5462f932dd02a2f0138019acd705ed9c237a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779438632", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716110/b6ed5462f932dd02a2f0138019acd705ed9c237a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779438632", "website": "https://phiality.com/rootkit-protocol-death", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</